USAGE
  agentbus [flags] <command> [args...]

AGENT COMMANDS
  status:         declare your state
  report:         publish a report
  reports:        list or read reports
  background:     show background work
  handoff:        declare or list hand-offs
  checkback:      say when to look again

MESSAGE COMMANDS
  cmd:            send a directive
  reply:          answer on a thread
  notify:         post a notice
  thread:         show one thread
  ask:            ask a person questions
  asks:           list asks and answers
  answer:         answer an ask's question
  listen:         tail the streams live
  subscribe:      wait for one command
  history:        re-read the past

REVIEW COMMANDS
  challenge:      open a 4-eyes gate
  verdict:        record a 4-eyes verdict
  verdicts:       show 4-eyes verdicts
  gate:           list or close open gates
  audit:          the audit trail

WORK COMMANDS
  board:          the shared task board
  request:        tracked requests
  retro:          a task's retrospective
  plan:           the batch's plan
  idea:           the project's ideas
  merge-queue:    what waits for merge
  deliver:        push and open a PR
  ci:             the CI loop
  run:            the run budget

TERMINAL COMMANDS
  agents:         every agent's state
  pop:            start a role's terminal
  retire:         close a role's terminal
  reload:         restart an idle agent
  swap:           swap an agent's profile
  swaps:          the swap ledger
  pane:           print an agent's terminal id
  bind:           bind a verified pane
  screen:         print an agent's screen
  attach:         attach to an agent's terminal
  self-repair:    clear a crash loop
  pilot:          show the pilot lease

PROJECT COMMANDS
  up:             provision and start a project
  start:          start the project here
  down:           stop a project's services
  pause:          wake nobody until then
  resume:         end a pause or suspension
  suspend:        put projects to sleep
  shutdown:       end the team's work
  projects:       every known project
  service:        the project's user services
  holder:         serve the agent terminals
  dispatch:       run the wake dispatcher
  missions:       run the missions conductor
  mission:        operate missions

USAGE COMMANDS
  usage:          per-agent model and context
  budget:         account usage windows
  tokens:         tokens spent
  quota:          providers' usage windows
  models:         this machine's model table
  refresh:        publish agents' usage
  limits:         size and retention limits

ADMIN COMMANDS
  config:         show the settings
  identity:       your name as a person
  notifications:  the notification targets
  roles:          the role manifest
  health:         the project's health
  backup:         archive this host's projects
  restore:        restore an archive
  update:         install the latest release
  mem:            the shared memory
  check:          the holder's live check
  term:           record a client fixture
  version:        protocol version and build
  help:           help about a command

INTERNAL COMMANDS
  setup:          the installer in Go
  peer:           a local test peer
  fake-client:    a fake Claude Code
  statusline:     Claude Code's statusLine

FLAGS
  -p, --project <project>  project namespace (or AGENT_BUS_PROJECT)
  -H, --host <host>        Redis host (overrides REDIS_HOST)
  -h, --help               show help for a command

EXAMPLES
  $ agentbus up
  $ agentbus status
  $ agentbus board
  $ agentbus update

LEARN MORE
  Use `agentbus help <command>` for more about a command.
